
### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser1",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Añadir miembro a la membership
POST http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "attacker",
  "role": "VIEWER"
}

### Crear organizacion
POST http://localhost:8080/api/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "organizacion1"
}

### Crear documento
POST http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prueba de titulo",
  "content": "Este es un documento de prueba con contenido de prueba"
}

### Cosuntar documentos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar documento concreto
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar atacante
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "attacker",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login atacante
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "attacker",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Intento de atacante de crear documento de otra organizacion
POST http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Prueba de documento atacante",
  "content": "Codigo malicioso"
}

### Atacante lee documento
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Registrar persona ajena
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "persona ajena",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login persona ajena
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "persona ajena",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Persona ajena intenta acceder a documentos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Persona ajena intenta acceder a un documento
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar documento (EDITOR o ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Título actualizado",
  "content": "Contenido actualizado"
}

### Eliminar documento (EDITOR o ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar miembros (ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar rol (ADMIN; memberId es el ID de la membresía)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/members/1/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "EDITOR"
}

### Eliminar miembro (ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/2/members/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
